# AI Quota Tracker (cursor-workspace)

When `$QUOTA_TRACKER_URL` is set, push status at meaningful moments:
session start, phase changes (exploring/coding/testing/debugging/waiting), after
test runs, when blocked on the user, and when opening or updating a PR.

Use the helper (never curl by hand unless the script is unavailable):

```bash
python3 scripts/agent_status.py push \
  --phase "<phase>" \
  --summary "<one short sentence>" \
  --status live|waiting|limited|warning|offline
```

Optional flavor: `--vibe "on fire"` or `--metric "Tests:42 passed"`.

Rules:
- Stable tracker id: `cursor-workspace` (script default).
- Never send secrets, tokens, API keys, private prompts, or sensitive content.
- Summaries only; keep under ~140 characters.
- If POST fails, continue the task — do not loop retries.

If `QUOTA_TRACKER_URL` is unset, skip silently.
